  "description": "An elevation of privilege vulnerability exists when the Windows Shell fails to validate folder shortcuts. An attacker who successfully exploited the vulnerability could elevate privileges by escaping a sandbox.\nTo exploit this vulnerability, an attacker would require unprivileged execution on the victim system.\nThe security update addresses the vulnerability by correctly validating folder shortcuts.",
